 ## Unreleased
 
+- Students with no graded work yet get the letter `NG` in their course grade, the class report and the term grades file, instead of a blank.
 - New `flat` late rule: late work loses `late.flat` percent (default 20) of the assignment's points, however late it is.
 - `gradebook report --sort grade` lists the highest percent first and students with no grade last; `--sort name` stays the default.
 - Score sheets have a `name` column after `student_id`, written as `Last, First`.
